{
  "name": "rust-gmp",
  "description": "This crate provides idiomatic Rust bindings for the GNU Multiple Precision Arithmetic Library (GMP), facilitating high-performance arbitrary-precision calculations. It encapsulates low-level FFI primitives for integers, rationals, and floating-point numbers into memory-safe types while implementing standard traits for operator overloading and string conversion. The library manages complex C-style lifecycles via RAII and provides thread-safe access to GMP's robust suite of numeric algorithms.",
